OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start this morning
OL,6,Facross the south, but rather cloudy
OL,7,Felsewhere with rain moving into
OL,8,FCumbria. The cloud will spread further
OL,9,Fsouth throughout the morning, with
OL,10,Fsome spots of rain also spreading
OL,11,Fsouth later in the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA few more showers are
OL,14,Fpossible this evening, with a few
OL,15,Fheavy downpours at times. Turning
OL,16,Fdrier through the night with clear
OL,17,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
