OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry on Monday with plenty of
OL,6,Fsunshine and light winds. Sunshine
OL,7,Fwill turn a little hazy later in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling warm in the
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FLargely dry with sunny spells over the
OL,13,Fnext few days, and perhaps the odd
OL,14,Fshower. Turning increasingly hot and
OL,15,Fmore humid later in the week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
